sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Overview Screen
    participant A as Articles Service
    participant J as Jobs Service

    UI->>A: POST /api/articles/{id}/inspect
    A->>J: create job { id: job_yyy, type: inspect, status: running }
    A-->>UI: 202 { jobId: "job_yyy", status: "running" }

    Note over A,J: gate check runs (word count · section integrity · …)
    A->>J: update job { status: done, result: { gate: "warn" } }

    UI->>J: GET /api/jobs/job_yyy
    J-->>UI: { status: "done", result: { gate: "warn" } }
    UI->>A: GET /api/articles?page=1
    A-->>UI: refreshed row with gate = warn badge